# Secrets — never commit these.
# NOTE: .dev.vars alone is NOT enough. Before this change `.env` and
# `keys.txt` were NOT ignored, so a single stray file would have landed raw
# API keys in a public repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
keys.txt
keys*.txt
*.pem
*.p12
credentials.json
service-account*.json

